{
 "_about": "One row per clip to fetch from Mixamo on the BOG (tools/mixamo_fetch.py). `file` is the FBX name that lands in anims/, `role` is the game's name for the move; several rows per role are candidates to choose between in preview. A row with `mixamo_query` instead of `mixamo_id` fetches every search result as `<file>-<Name>`, or only those named in `mixamo_keep`. `in_place` is false everywhere on purpose: Mixamo's in-place export flattens the hip bob along with the travel, so travel is stripped at import instead, where it also yields the authored speed. `loop` is provisional until the animator is rebuilt.",
